1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:06,647
Everyone is a little strange. Serve the odd ones. Refuse whoever isn't on camera.

2
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,650
Night one. Don't mess it up.

3
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:13,272
Okay. Let's see who shows up.

4
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:20,642
Ten skewers. Cook them until they stop talking.

5
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:25,255
...Okay. The customer is always right.

6
00:00:25,949 --> 00:00:26,742
Check the camera.

7
00:00:28,349 --> 00:00:30,804
On camera. Just weird.

8
00:00:31,549 --> 00:00:33,927
Don't ask. Just cook.

9
00:00:41,077 --> 00:00:41,789
Payment.

10
00:00:42,069 --> 00:00:42,623
...That's a leaf.

11
00:00:42,903 --> 00:00:44,224
It is very valuable.

12
00:00:44,504 --> 00:00:45,854
Fine. Serve.

13
00:00:49,077 --> 00:00:49,775
Next.

14
00:00:52,877 --> 00:00:55,614
Iced tea. Less sugar. Less... you.

15
00:00:57,877 --> 00:01:01,583
Okay. Normal. She is... only staring.

16
00:01:02,133 --> 00:01:02,925
Check the camera.

17
00:01:04,533 --> 00:01:05,581
...Nobody there.

18
00:01:05,861 --> 00:01:07,405
She is not on camera.

19
00:01:11,933 --> 00:01:14,889
Refuse. Refuse. REFUSE.

20
00:01:18,133 --> 00:01:18,754
Closing.

21
00:01:22,133 --> 00:01:24,094
Next night. Who isn't human?
